&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE Assign-Frame V-table-Win
PROCEDURE Assign-Frame :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:
  Parameters:  <none>
  Notes:
------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

ASSIGN frame {&FRAME-NAME}
TimePeriod
.
vStrBuf  = TimePeriod:screen-value .
assign
vStartPoint = date ( integer ( substring ( vStrBuf, 1, 2 ) ),
                    integer ( "01" ) , integer( trim( substring( vStrBuf, 3 ) ) ) )
vEndPoint = date ( integer ( substring ( vStrBuf, 1, 2 ) ), integer ( "01" ) ,
                  integer ( trim ( substring ( vStrBuf , 3 ) ) ) ) .
run gbl/lastday.p ( input vEndPoint, output vEndLastDay ) .


vEndPoint = date( integer( substring( vStrBuf, 1, 2 ) ), vEndLastDay,
                 integer( trim( substring( vStrBuf, 3 ) ) ) ) .

END PROCEDURE.

